  m_text: 'A texture is a grid of pixels. More pixels look sharper up close, but weigh more in memory and in the project.


    <b>Predict:</b> The three panels show the same photo at different sizes. Which has the most pixels?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Move the Scene view close to each panel.

    2. Select each panel''s texture in the Project window.

    3. Read the size under its preview, and its Max Size.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Textured materials: every set there is 1K (1024 pixels wide)</color></size>'
