  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A tileable texture repeats. Over a large surface the repeats form a visible grid, and the eye finds it. A Detail map breaks it: a large, soft texture laid over the whole floor varies the brightness, so no two repeats look the same.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> This floor shows its texture at real size. From the camera, what shows that it is one small texture repeated?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Look at the floor from the station camera.\n2. In the floor's material, open Detail Inputs and assign T_Large-Variation to Base Map, Tiling 0.11.\n3. Look again.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Textured materials, 1 \xB7 Floors (Concrete paving)</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
